WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.262
Theo: I can't believe school is over.

2
00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:14.178
Skyler: Now we have all summer to play with our pets!

3
00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.585
Ben: I don't.

4
00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:19.220
Riley: What do you mean, Ben?

5
00:00:19.221 --> 00:00:23.186
Ben: My family is taking a train trip.

6
00:00:23.187 --> 00:00:25.451
Sarah: That's exciting!

7
00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:28.489
Ben: There's only one bad thing.

8
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.447
Riley: What's that?

9
00:00:30.448 --> 00:00:33.297
Ben: No pets are allowed on the train.

10
00:00:33.298 --> 00:00:37.926
Speedy can't come with us!

11
00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:39.975
Riley: Don't worry, Ben.

12
00:00:39.976 --> 00:00:43.870
We'll take care of Speedy for you.

13
00:00:43.871 --> 00:00:46.171
Skyler: He can stay at my house.

14
00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:48.379
That will be fun for him.

15
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.645
Chatter: Fun, fun, fun!

16
00:00:50.646 --> 00:00:56.888
Ben: Thanks! I just wish Speedy could come on the train.

17
00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.649
Theo: Hey, I have an idea.

18
00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.710
Riley: What is

19
00:01:01.711 --> 00:01:05.295
it? Theo: I have an electric train set in my

20
00:01:05.296 --> 00:01:08.497
room. Let's give our pets a train ride.

21
00:01:08.498 --> 00:01:10.930
Sarah: That's a great idea!

22
00:01:10.931 --> 00:01:16.039
Riley: Let's go!

23
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.206
Theo: Here's my train.

24
00:01:18.207 --> 00:01:20.708
Ben: What a great train set.

25
00:01:20.709 --> 00:01:24.206
Sarah: It has towns and bridges.

26
00:01:24.207 --> 00:01:31.472
Theo: You flip a switch and the train goes around. See?

27
00:01:31.473 --> 00:01:33.265
Chatter: Woo, woo!

28
00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:35.905
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

29
00:01:35.906 --> 00:01:42.854
Riley: Sorry, Snooks. You're too big to go on the train.

30
00:01:42.855 --> 00:01:45.143
Theo: Time for the ride!

31
00:01:45.144 --> 00:01:47.591
Hang on, Whiskers!

32
00:01:47.592 --> 00:01:49.436
Chatter: Woo, woo!

33
00:01:49.437 --> 00:01:52.000
Ben: Sit here, Speedy.

34
00:01:52.001 --> 00:01:56.005
Theo: Frankie can ride on the caboose.

35
00:01:56.006 --> 00:01:58.555
Sarah: Mittens will wait in the train station.

36
00:01:58.556 --> 00:02:09.799
Theo: All aboard! Here we go!

